   221	    ``ckpt/exp10/released_k8_all``, a different execution) as the CPU record's, and the
   222	    finish script reached ``FINISH DONE`` with them (round-4 review, finding 1).  The CPU
   223	    record's reports were regenerated in place and name their own directory, so every
   224	    report is bound the same way: by the run directory it names.
   225	    """
   226	    label = label or "%s %s" % (os.path.basename(str(run_dir).rstrip("/")), kind)
